WEBVTT

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.690
Until the very end, I'll...

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.400
What "end?"

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.510
You've really gotten yourselves into trouble this time.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.440
What do you want, Haruna?

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.650
Reckless use of a daughter...

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.670
...unsanctioned combat in the city and property damage.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.790
Tomoharu Natsume...

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.250
...and members of the Rakurowa High School Science Club...

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.510
...are to be detained.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.480
<i>Asura Cryin' 2</i>

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.750
"Moment of Annihilation, Darkness of Extinction"

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:08.830
Why are we getting arrested?

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.600
This doesn't make any sense.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.800
Do something, Tomoharu!

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.150
If you've got a problem, tell it to the GD's.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.120
Kanade-chan, how are you feeling?

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:21.880
I'm feeling much better.

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.140
That medicine helped a lot.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.430
In any case, you shouldn't be so reckless any more.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.870
It's the only way to keep you from vanishing.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.890
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:41.290
I haven't done anything, and I don't know anything!

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.200
Yeah.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:43.970
We're just victims here.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.400
I don't know about that.

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.610
Haven't you been listening?

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.660
We were attacked by Hiwako Torishima and a woman wearing a weird mask.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:54.540
And I went to save them.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.210
This is ridiculous.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:01.000
Will you get the next person?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:01.330
Yes.

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:02.560
Sheesh.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.560
Why doesn't she believe us?

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.410
You aren't known for being reliable.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.930
Why don't you tell us what you know?

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.100
You don't know what you're doing.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.950
The situation is far more serious than you think.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.710
That masked woman will come after us again.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:29.820
What is it?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.000
I-it's...

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.020
It's her!

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.380
Look behind you!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.370
You won't be able to fool me that easily.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.000
Aenka!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.690
Cut those fuses, and it will all be over.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.720
We'll all blow up.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.440
This way! Come on!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:23.870
What?

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.070
President Rikka!

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:27.430
She got us.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.830
That masked woman took Ania Fortuna.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.880
Shuri-san, where are we going?

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.820
I'm sure you already know...

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:49.280
...but the Asura Machina's powers won't work against that masked woman.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:51.750
Which means we have to turn to her.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:52.450
Of course.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:55.510
President Toru.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.740
She'd be able to help us.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:00.820
Exactly.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:07.110
She should be in the student council office around this time.

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.310
There she is!

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.250
President Toru!

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:23.850
No...

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:26.620
President Toru!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:36.280
Do you think President Toru will be alright?

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:39.310
I heard she was taken to the hospital...

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.360
...but considering what happened, we don't have much hope.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.480
Why...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:49.790
The enemy must have known we would go to President Toru for help.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:54.020
You're right. They saw right through our plan.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:58.250
In any case, we should wait and see what they'll do first.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:01.570
You think they'll contact us?

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:02.980
Most likely, yes.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.980
It would have been easy to kill us.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.500
But for some reason, they didn't.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.180
There must be a catch.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.500
A catch?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.170
There it is.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.350
"Let's trade hostages. We'll release Ania Fortuna and your president in exchange for Tomoharu Natsume. Meet us at the site of the Meiotei."

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:21.280
Shuri-san...

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:23.160
Midnight, tonight...

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.160
...at the site of the Meiotei.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:28.740
That's where they'll trade you, Tomoharu...

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:31.830
...for the captive Nia-chan and President Kagayaki.

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:33.000
What?

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.850
They have the president, too?

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:38.060
I don't know what they're up to, but it certainly seems that way.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.140
But...

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.110
Looks like you're in trouble.

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:44.840
What are you doing here?

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:47.810
I thought you might need me.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.690
Actually, the Student Union has given the official order...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:54.180
...to kill Hiwako Torishima.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.830
Kill her?

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:57.740
Yes. I'll take her out.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:00.530
In any case...

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:03.320
In any case, we have to go.

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.110
Nicely said, Tomo.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.780
If that's the case, I'll go...

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.220
You can't.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.480
Just stay here.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:12.570
Yeah.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.790
It's almost time.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.350
Nobody's here.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:29.320
No, they've probably been watching us from somewhere.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:31.670
Just like they were watching us at Rakurowa High School.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:45.240
Nia!

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.000
President!

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.090
Are you alright?

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:49.700
What's going on?

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:53.760
Let's skip the troublesome negotiations.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.540
Why don't you come over here, Natsume-sama?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.860
We'll send Ania over once you're halfway here.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:05.010
Once you're over here...

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.470
...we'll send President Kagayaki.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:07.620
Understood.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.180
Before we do that, tell us one thing.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.180
What do you intend to do with Tomo?

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:16.140
I doubt you would understand even if I told you.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:19.810
Come, Natsume-sama.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.720
Unfortunately for you, there won't be any deals.

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.920
Shirogane, draw!

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:03.640
Nia, this way!

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.750
Come, Kurogane!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.130
Think you're clever, do you?

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.730
Takatsuki!

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:23.700
I will protect you...

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.200
...until the very end!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:29.840
Do you really think you stand a chance against a Torishima in your condition?

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.280
I won't let you hurt Natsume-kun!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.450
You're foolish, Kanade Takatsuki.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.740
I'll make it quick.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.150
Hyo-o!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.000
Engetsu!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.580
Takatsuki, stop!

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:52.750
Don't do this!

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.460
Get out of my way, daughter!

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.530
This ends now, ex-handler!

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.310
Toru!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.950
President Toru? You're alright?

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.480
But why?

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.450
Pretty good trick, don't you think?

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:28.620
Why, Toru?

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.350
Why are you doing this?

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:37.760
Why?

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.010
Yukari...

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:52.470
Shuri!

00:10:58.640 --> 00:10:59.380
It's over.

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:03.430
Shuri!

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.900
Shuri!

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:22.760
Shuri, get it together!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:23.380
Shuri!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:29.570
What is this?

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.600
How did this happen?

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:37.530
It's time for you to die, Kanade Takatsuki.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:44.730
Takatsuki!

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.320
S-stop.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.280
I'll do whatever you want!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:54.450
Just stop this!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:57.690
You misunderstand, Natsume-sama.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:02.030
This is exactly what we wanted.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.060
We wanted you to be hopeless and cornered.

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:08.200
What?

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.100
I see Naotaka Natsume is here.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:24.970
So you're the one derailing history...

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.620
...Toru Kitsutaka.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.760
I didn't expect my plans to become this derailed.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.570
You mean your plan to destroy the central vortex?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.310
Isn't that right?

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:46.480
You're trying to destroy the superstring gravity reactor that makes travel between worlds possible.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.210
Why would you ask that?

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:51.150
I wanted to make sure I had the right answer...

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.380
...before I killed you.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:57.380
It's pointless, Toru Kitsutaka.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:06.480
Absolute control over space.

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:11.800
Are you using Kurogane's gravity manipulation and Shirogane's space manipulation powers...

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.270
...simultaneously?

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.790
Kurogane and Shirogane's powers?

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:20.760
Hagane is the final form of the Asura Machina.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.280
Not even you can defeat it.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.980
It's time for you to go, Toru Kitsutaka.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.660
I can't have you ruining my plans any...

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:47.580
Impossible...

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.670
President...

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.520
Koala...

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:12.870
President, what are you...

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:21.560
Takatsuki!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.520
How dare you...

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.050
Takatsuki!

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.950
And now we just have to kill the spares!

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:08.590
Tomoharu, take Kanade-chan and Nia-chan and run!

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:09.920
Hurry!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:11.880
But what about you?

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:15.410
Tomoharu, you're more than a spare.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.560
I'm s...

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:41.350
Shuri-san!

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:49.600
On your guard.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.590
That's enough, Hiwako.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.470
There's no need for more bloodshed.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.000
We did it.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.880
Our wish will be granted.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.170
Please excuse me, master.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.020
Master?

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.660
What's going on, president?

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.070
Do you know what this is?

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.510
That's...

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:18.830
The legacy of Kuremizaki.

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:23.730
Kagakagari was after this without even knowing what it was.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:28.230
In some ways, it is the tool that would grant his wish.

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:31.840
This is Naotaka Natsume's Asura Machina...

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.550
...the altar of Hagane.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.750
Did you know...

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:42.450
...handlers are humans that have injected their bodies with nanomachines...

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:46.120
...in order to control Asura Machina?

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:52.700
And in a handler that has lost his burial doll...

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:59.510
...the nanomachines turn into a mechanism that repels magic.

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:03.480
This is what makes an ex-handler immune to magic.

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.480
Why are you telling me this?

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:14.880
I'm trying to tell you that ex-handlers are qualified to become burial dolls.

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:19.690
Unfortunately, the soul of the burial doll I loved has disappeared.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:23.220
But if I open this altar now...

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.100
No...

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.700
Don't do it!

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.200
President Toru!

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:47.510
Kurogane, stop President Toru!

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:53.240
Come, Charlize!

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:55.680
Misao!

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:10.480
You're an Asura Cryin'.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:15.650
Is this what you were after all along?

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.300
Indeed it is.

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.820
That's why I cornered you...

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.410
...and forced Naotaka Natsume out of hiding.

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:27.580
Thanks to you, I got what I wanted.

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:31.400
The power of Hagane and an Asura Cryin'.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:35.690
With this plug-in you were researching...

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:40.450
...I can go to the past and create a third world.

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:42.380
How did you get the igniter?

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.760
I took it just before blowing up your house.

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:47.350
A third world...

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.520
What world is that?

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.840
A world with Aki.

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:57.130
I lost my beloved queen in this world.

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:01.570
When you lose a game of chess, what can you do except flip the board over and start again?

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.890
Wait a minute! What's going to happen to this world?

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.180
What will happen to those left behind?

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.320
That's irrelevant to me.

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.500
I can't say I care.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.520
I wouldn't be adverse to taking you with me...

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:18.220
...to thank you for what you've done.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:21.130
Will you come with me, Tomoharu Natsume?

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:43.040
No.

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:47.890
I won't let things go your way!

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.450
Go, Kurogane!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.710
What are you so mad about?

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:57.000
I told you I'd take you with me.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.260
Shut up!

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:04.900
What a shame.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.250
From the forge deeper than darkness...

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.250
...it is the steel tempered by the hammer of science.

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.420
I'm counting on you, Hagane.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:14.500
My dreams are about to come true.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.870
Go, Kurogane!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.010
Misao!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.470
Finish him off!

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:57.480
Master...

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:01.830
Hagane's overwhelming magic...

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.910
...is warping space itself.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:05.320
What?

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:11.640
I'll be taking this back!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.100
Nia!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.170
Don't worry.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:38.840
You have me, Tomo.

00:23:20.270 --> 00:23:21.390
Promises.

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:23.060
Discussions of dreams.

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:24.650
Plans for tomorrow.

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:26.060
Remembering.

00:23:26.060 --> 00:23:27.880
Unforgettable.

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:28.820
Love.

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:29.690
Hate.

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:31.690
Everything is an illusion.

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:35.010
"Future Without Memories"
